        "tag": "title",
        "text": "On the road: traffic and driving"
      },
      {
        "y": 70.7,
        "x0": 75.1,
        "x1": 265.9,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Driving and traffic regulations"
      },
      {
        "y": 133.2,
        "x0": 95.7,
        "x1": 502.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In the UK, you must give way1 at a give-way sign and at a roundabout, where trafﬁc coming from the"
      },
      {
        "y": 144.2,
        "x0": 95.7,
        "x1": 453,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "right has the right of way2. You must give way to pedestrians at a pedestrian crossing3."
      },
      {
        "y": 159.5,
        "x0": 95.7,
        "x1": 444.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In some countries, sounding/beeping4 your horn is prohibited, except in emergencies."
      },
      {
        "y": 174.7,
        "x0": 95.8,
        "x1": 428.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In most countries, jumping5 a red light is a serious offence, as is reckless6 driving."
      },
      {
        "y": 190,
        "x0": 95.8,
        "x1": 505.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In many parts of the world, drink-driving7 or drug-driving8 can result in a heavy ﬁne or imprisonment."
      },
      {
        "y": 201,
        "x0": 95.7,
        "x1": 518.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Drivers may be asked by a police ofﬁcer to take a breathalyser9 test. Hit-and-run10 accidents are almost"
      },
      {
        "y": 212,
        "x0": 95.8,
        "x1": 516.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "always considered to be grave offences and may result in a ban11 for several years and/or imprisonment."
      },
      {
        "y": 223,
        "x0": 95.7,
        "x1": 519.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In the UK, less serious breaches of trafﬁc regulations may lead to penalty points12 on the driver’s licence."
      },
      {
        "y": 234,
        "x0": 95.7,
        "x1": 471.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In many countries, on-the-spot13 ﬁnes may be issued for careless driving and other offences."
      },
      {
        "y": 249.2,
        "x0": 95.7,
        "x1": 480.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In the European Union, exhaust emissions14 must meet certain standards, and the car must be"
      },
      {
        "y": 260.2,
        "x0": 95.7,
        "x1": 494.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "roadworthy15, which includes a minimum depth of tyre tread16: driving with a bald17 tyre is against"
      },
      {
        "y": 272.3,
        "x0": 95.7,
        "x1": 127.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the law."
      },
      {
        "y": 295.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 502,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 stop at a junction before entering a bigger road 2 is allowed to go before other traffic 3 often called a"
      },
      {
        "y": 307.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 518.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "zebra crossing when it has black and white stripes 4 beeping is less formal than sounding 5 not stopping at"
      },
      {
        "y": 319.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 492.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 very dangerous, without any care for others 7 driving after consuming alcohol above the official limit"
