        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Traffic problems"
      },
      {
        "y": 418.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 431.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "It was the rush hour, and there was a long tailback. [line of slow or stopped traffic]"
      },
      {
        "y": 430.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 503.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "There’s always congestion in the city centre. [situation in which there is a lot of traffic that can’t move."
      },
      {
        "y": 443.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 396.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In some cities, cars have to pay a congestion charge to go into the city centre.]"
      },
      {
        "y": 454.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 446.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "You have to pay a toll on the new motorway. [a charge you have to pay to use the road]"
      },
      {
        "y": 466.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 495.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "There was a pile-up involving ten cars, because of the fog, so the road was closed and we were"
      },
      {
        "y": 478.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 512.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "diverted onto a narrow country lane. [crash between several or many cars] [directed away from our road]"
      },
      {
        "y": 490.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 497.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Overnight snow caused disruption this morning on many roads, but it has cleared now. [when a"
      },
      {
        "y": 503.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 395.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "system, process or event is prevented from continuing as usual or as expected]"
      },
      {
        "y": 514.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 510.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I had stupidly parked in a tow-away zone and came back to find my car had gone! [area where your"
      },
      {
        "y": 527.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 261.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "car may be taken away if you park illegally]"
      },
      {
        "y": 538.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 514.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I only parked for a few minutes outside the station, but when I came out my car had been clamped."
      },
      {
        "y": 551.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 349.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "[fitted with a metal device on the wheel to prevent it from moving]"
      },
      {
        "y": 562.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 514.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I saw two men fighting next to their cars. I think it was a case of road rage. [anger or violence between"
      },
      {
        "y": 575.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 271.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "drivers because of difficult driving conditions]"
      },
      {
        "y": 586.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 511.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The road was wet and I skidded on a bend and almost crashed. [lost control of the steering so that the"
      },
      {
        "y": 599.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 188.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "car slid across the road]"
      },
      {
        "y": 610.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 498.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "There was a head-on collision on the main road between here and the next village last night. [two"
      },
      {
        "y": 623.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 271.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "vehicles hitting each other directly in the front]"
      },
      {
        "y": 648.6,
        "x0": 257.2,
        "x1": 340.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "(Radio announcement)"
      },
      {
        "y": 660.6,
        "x0": 263.2,
        "x1": 489.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "There was an accident at the junction between the A476 and"
      },
      {
        "y": 672.6,
