        "text": "25.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 473.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Fill the gaps in these sentences using words and phrases from the opposite page."
      },
      {
        "y": 88,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 313.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 We can’t park here; it’s a zone."
      },
      {
        "y": 100,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 448.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 There was a five-mile on the motorway because of road works."
      },
      {
        "y": 112,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 419.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 Fog caused a number of , one of which involved 15 cars."
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 520.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 If it’s a sign, you don’t have to stop if the road is clear, but if it’s a stop sign, then"
      },
      {
        "y": 136,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 220.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "you must always stop."
      },
      {
        "y": 148,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 498,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Who has the at a pedestrian crossing in your country? Cars or pedestrians?"
      },
      {
        "y": 160,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 442.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 It was a accident, but the police have a description of the car."
      },
      {
        "y": 172,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 512.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 The permitted level of is to be lowered in an attempt to reduce air pollution in"
      },
      {
        "y": 184,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 167.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "big cities."
      },
      {
        "y": 196,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 512.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 He was given a test and it was discovered he had consumed a huge amount of"
      },
      {
        "y": 208,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 524.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "alcohol. He was charged with , fined and given three on his licence."
      },
      {
        "y": 220,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 531.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 In some countries, drivers their just because they get frustrated. As a"
      },
      {
        "y": 232,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 303.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "result, the city streets are incredibly noisy."
      },
      {
        "y": 244,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 443.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "10 The bad weather caused a lot of to traffic all over the country."
      },
      {
        "y": 256,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 537.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "11 People are being encouraged to leave their cars at home in an effort to reduce in the"
      },
      {
        "y": 268,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 173.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "city centre."
      },
      {
        "y": 284.3,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "25.2"
      },
      {
        "y": 286.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 478.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Respond to these comments as in the example, so that your response explains the"
      },
      {
        "y": 298.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 422.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "meaning of the underlined words. Use words from the opposite page."
      },
      {
        "y": 315.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 355.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 A: I came out and saw a big metal thing on my wheels."
      },
      {
        "y": 327.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 246.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Oh, so your car had been clamped!"
      },
      {
        "y": 339.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 343.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: Yes. I had to pay a lot of money to get it released."
      },
      {
        "y": 351.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 510.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 A: As I drove round the corner, there was some ice on the road and I lost control of the steering."
      },
      {
        "y": 363.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 303.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Oh, so you ."
      },
      {
        "y": 375.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 514.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 A: The two women were obviously having an argument about the way one of them had been"
      },
      {
        "y": 387.3,
        "x0": 138.9,
        "x1": 367,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "driving. Then suddenly they started hitting each other!"
      },
      {
        "y": 399.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 370.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Oh, I guess it was a case of ."
      },
      {
        "y": 411.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 430,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 A: The police officer looked at two of my tyres and said they were illegal."
      },
      {
        "y": 423.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 399.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Oh, so your tyres were , were they?"
      },
      {
        "y": 435.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 467.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 A: The road was closed. Two lorries had come straight at each other and crashed."
      },
      {
        "y": 447.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 319.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Oh, so it was a ."
      },
      {
        "y": 459.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 464.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 A: The police officer fined me there and then. I have to pay up within seven days."
      },
      {
        "y": 471.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 426,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Oh, really? I didn’t know they could give ."
      },
      {
        "y": 483.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 487.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: Yes. You have no choice. They just give it to you and you can’t dispute it at the time."
      },
      {
        "y": 495.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 467.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 A: The man at the garage said my car wasn’t in a fit condition to be driven legally."
      },
      {
        "y": 507.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 316.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Oh, so it’s not ."
      },
      {
        "y": 519.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 342,
        "tag": "main",
